<title>UK: Dixons leads UK retail shares higher.</title>
<headline>Dixons leads UK retail shares higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dixons Group Plc led a rally for retail sector shares on Friday, although there was no specific news behind the rise, traders said.</p>
<p>Dixons shares were up 18-1/2p at 518p by 1046 GMT.</p>
<p>Other sector climbers included Next Plc, up 10p at 593-1/2p, Argos Plc up 10-1/2p at 679-1/2p, and Boots Co Plc up 7-1/2p at 700-1/2p.</p>
<p>&quot;We're just rolling with the punches,&quot; traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom + 44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
